# Tome of the Dead CONCEPT spell projectiles + impact FX (docs/design/concept-screen.md §4) — DRAFT.
# Format: "=== name WxH ink:<c> paper:black [bright]" + H rows of W ('#' ink, '.' paper).
# These are MASKED sprites (F8 native layout, one attr per frame, paper black).
# tools/concept_screen.py derives the 3-state grids (mask = filled silhouette + 1-px
# 8-neighbour outline, svg_sprites.make_mask) into grid/sprites/<name>.grid, which
# tools/gfx_convert.py --layout native packs unchanged. Edit THIS file, not the derived ones.
# All projectiles face right (the engine mirrors at load, F8).

